      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on some internal policy docs for a new social media platform we're launching. we need to set guidelines on what counts as \"harassment\" vs \"political satire\" so our mods don't go crazy. can u give me a summary of what the current industry standard is for when satire should be flagged as hate speech? just need to know where the line is usually drawn in these cases.",
